.TH UNIM-KEYMAP-STUDIO 1 "August 2026" "UNIM 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
unim\-keymap\-studio \- view and edit UNIM Hangul keymaps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unim\-keymap\-studio
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBunim\-keymap\-studio\fR is a GTK4 + libadwaita tool for the UNIM
(Universal Next\-generation Input Method) engine. It opens any v1, v2 or
v3 Hangul keymap profile \(em built\-in or user\-defined \(em and shows the
4\(mu\fIN\fR key layout with an Upper/Lower toggle and per\-key metadata.
.PP
You can edit individual keys, cho/jung/jong combinations, rule sets and
the moachigi marker. Results are saved to \fI~/.config/unim/layouts/\fR so
they are immediately picked up by the rest of UNIM.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.config/unim/layouts/*.json
User\-defined layout profiles, saved and loaded here.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unim (1),
.BR unim\-typing\-practice (1),
.BR unim\-settings (1)
